{"id":"98c11a88e50650e8","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-gentzen-consistency-interface.md","title":"Gentzen 一致性目标的对象句接口","display":"df-gentzen-consistency-interface — Gentzen 一致性目标的对象句接口","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-gentzen-consistency-interface","aliases":["18-df-gentzen-consistency-interface","18-df-003"],"display":"df-gentzen-consistency-interface — Gentzen 一致性目标的对象句接口","depends_on":["[[18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface]]","[[18-df-provable]]","[[18-df-sentence]]","[[18-df-transfinite-induction]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"1;7.5.2","source_printed_pages":"4;126–127","source_pdf_pages":"15;136–137","source_correspondence":"object-sentence-interface-only","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-gentzen-consistency-interface"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-gentzen-consistency-interface</span><span>18-df-003</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gentzen-consistency-interface — Gentzen 一致性目标的对象句接口"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ad4722aacf87aee1\" href=\"?note=ad4722aacf87aee1\" title=\"18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface\">18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9cea4880793901f3\" href=\"?note=9cea4880793901f3\" title=\"18-df-provable\">18-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"20cb1a93869734ac\" href=\"?note=20cb1a93869734ac\" title=\"18-df-sentence\">18-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3792e1826de54ef4\" href=\"?note=3792e1826de54ef4\" title=\"18-df-transfinite-induction\">18-df-transfinite-induction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"1;7.5.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"4;126–127"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"15;136–137"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"object-sentence-interface-only"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GentzenConsistency}_{\\mathcal P}(A_{\\mathrm{PRA}},I_{\\varepsilon_0},C_{\\mathrm{PA}})\">\\(\\mathrm{GentzenConsistency}_{\\mathcal P}(A_{\\mathrm{PRA}},I_{\\varepsilon_0},C_{\\mathrm{PA}})\\)</span> 为下式引入的三参数谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\">\\(\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9cea4880793901f3\" href=\"?note=9cea4880793901f3\" title=\"18-df-provable\">18-df-provable</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{\\mathrm{PRA}},A_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(A_{\\mathrm{PRA}},A_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> 是给定的相容语言呈示。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{\\varepsilon_0}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(I_{\\varepsilon_0}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> 是给定的、沿原书递归记号系统表达的对象归纳公理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(C_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> 是给定一致性对象句。句子接口见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"20cb1a93869734ac\" href=\"?note=20cb1a93869734ac\" title=\"18-df-sentence\">18-df-sentence</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N\">\\(\\mathfrak N\\)</span> 是具有同一签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的给定算术结构；假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N\\models C_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal P}(A_{\\mathrm{PA}})\">\\(\\mathfrak N\\models C_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal P}(A_{\\mathrm{PA}})\\)</span>，其中一致性及满足接口见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ad4722aacf87aee1\" href=\"?note=ad4722aacf87aee1\" title=\"18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface\">18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface</a>。</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3792e1826de54ef4\" href=\"?note=3792e1826de54ef4\" title=\"18-df-transfinite-induction\">18-df-transfinite-induction</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TI}(\\alpha,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{TI}(\\alpha,A)\\)</span> 是元语言语义谓词；不把它当作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{\\varepsilon_0}\">\\(I_{\\varepsilon_0}\\)</span> 的对象公式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GentzenConsistency}_{\\mathcal P}\n(A_{\\mathrm{PRA}},I_{\\varepsilon_0},C_{\\mathrm{PA}})\n\\longleftrightarrow\n(A_{\\mathrm{PRA}}\\cup I_{\\varepsilon_0})\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}C_{\\mathrm{PA}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{GentzenConsistency}_{\\mathcal P}\n(A_{\\mathrm{PRA}},I_{\\varepsilon_0},C_{\\mathrm{PA}})\n\\longleftrightarrow\n(A_{\\mathrm{PRA}}\\cup I_{\\varepsilon_0})\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}C_{\\mathrm{PA}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是历史一致性目标的明示输入接口，保留 definition 身份，不冒充已经完成具体算术编码的定理。§7.5.2 印刷p126先讨论 NT+TI(ε0,X)；印刷p127指出通过连续切消可加强为 PRA+PRWO(≺) 足够证明一致性。原稿把别册PRA、此册PA和未编码的语义TI直接相加，现明确三者必须先有相容对象语言呈示；具体证明见本册相应原子，不能由此接口定义得到。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface","status":"resolved","id":"ad4722aacf87aee1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"9cea4880793901f3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"20cb1a93869734ac","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-transfinite-induction","status":"resolved","id":"3792e1826de54ef4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-transfinite-induction]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"9cea4880793901f3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P$、$\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}$ 见 [[18-df-provable]]；$A_{\\mathrm{PRA}},A_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 是给定的相容语言呈示。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"20cb1a93869734ac","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I_{\\varepsilon_0}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ 是给定的、沿原书递归记号系统表达的对象归纳公理集；$C_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ 是给定一致性对象句。句子接口见 [[18-df-sentence]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface","status":"resolved","id":"ad4722aacf87aee1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak N$ 是具有同一签名 $S$ 的给定算术结构；假定 $\\mathfrak N\\models C_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal P}(A_{\\mathrm{PA}})$，其中一致性及满足接口见 [[18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-transfinite-induction","status":"resolved","id":"3792e1826de54ef4","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"[[18-df-transfinite-induction]] 的 $\\mathrm{TI}(\\alpha,A)$ 是元语言语义谓词；不把它当作 $I_{\\varepsilon_0}$ 的对象公式。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GentzenConsistency}_{\\mathcal P}(A_{\\mathrm{PRA}},I_{\\varepsilon_0},C_{\\mathrm{PA}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}","display":false},{"tex":"A_{\\mathrm{PRA}},A_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"I_{\\varepsilon_0}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"C_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak N","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak N\\models C_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal P}(A_{\\mathrm{PA}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TI}(\\alpha,A)","display":false},{"tex":"I_{\\varepsilon_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GentzenConsistency}_{\\mathcal P}\n(A_{\\mathrm{PRA}},I_{\\varepsilon_0},C_{\\mathrm{PA}})\n\\longleftrightarrow\n(A_{\\mathrm{PRA}}\\cup I_{\\varepsilon_0})\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}C_{\\mathrm{PA}}.","display":true}],"bytes":2418,"backlinks":[{"id":"3345a825b0656579","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal P,A_{\\mathrm{PRA}},I_{\\varepsilon_0},C_{\\mathrm{PA}}$ 满足 [[18-df-gentzen-consistency-interface]] 的全部输入条件及其语义对应假设：$A_{\\mathrm{PRA}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，$I_{\\varepsilon_0}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$，$C_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S$。$\\mathrm{GentzenConsistency}_{\\mathcal P}$ 为该上游的三参数谓词；$\\mathrm{GentzenTheorem}_{\\mathcal P}$ 是下式定义的同签名历史别名。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-gentzen-consistency-interface]]"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-gentzen-consistency-interface]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-gentzen-consistency-interface]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-gentzen-consistency-interface|18-df-gentzen-consistency-interface]]"},{"id":"09f8f6fb03023072","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-gentzen-consistency-interface|18-df-gentzen-consistency-interface]]"}],"outgoing":["ad4722aacf87aee1","9cea4880793901f3","20cb1a93869734ac","3792e1826de54ef4"]}